  "description": "The SKE Crystal Pro 600 Prefilled Pod Kit offers a convenient, rechargeable alternative to single-use disposables, while sporting the same colourful crystal chassis, lightweight, ergonomic form factor’ effortless operation, and premium flavours as the iconic, bestselling SKE Crystal Bar. with incredible flavour. This compact and stylish pod kit features a built-in 400mAh rechargeable battery, delivering up to 600 puffs per prefilled pod. Each pod is prefilled with 2ml of 20mg nic salt e-liquid, providing a smooth, satisfying vape with rapid relief from nicotine cravings. With intuitive inhale activation, the SKE Crystal Pro 600 is effortless to use—simply draw on the pod to enjoy an instantly satisfying MTL (mouth-to-lung) vape sensation. When the prefilled pod is empty, replace it with a new SKE Crystal Pro Pod, available in packs of two, to continue enjoying the experience or simply experiment with new SKE Crystal flavours from the collection. Designed for maximum ease and satisfaction, this kit is ideal for both new and experienced vapers looking for an efficient, flavour-packed device. Please Note: These kits do NOT come with a USB-C cable SKE Crystal Pro 600 Prefilled Kit Flavours • Berry Ice • Blueberry Raspberries • Blue Razz Lemonade • Blue Sour Raspberry • Cherry Ice • Cola Ice • Fizzy Cherry • Kiwi Passionfruit Guava • Lemon & Lime • Menthol • Pineapple Ice • Pink Lemonade • VMT • Watermelon Ice Shop SKE Crystal Pro 600 Refill Pods",
